# source archives — contents are extracted and tracked in this repo
*.zip
*.tar.gz

# Cloud-sync duplicates. Something syncing ~/Documents copies files as "name 2.ext", and the
# duplicates inside .next break `tsc` with duplicate-identifier errors. They are never real.
* 2.*
*\ 2.*

# iCloud collision artifacts.
#
# iCloud renames a file it thinks conflicts to "name 2.ext" mid-write. Two of these reached git
# ("settings 3.json", "settings 4.json"), and the same renaming produced the webpack cache ENOENTs
# that were misdiagnosed as a dying dev server. The real fix is excluding this folder from iCloud;
# this only stops the debris being committed.
* [0-9].json
* [0-9].css
* [0-9].ts
* [0-9].tsx
* [0-9].md
* [0-9].py
